{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Qeren Naftali fortress (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mikveh\" title=\"Mikveh\">Jewish ritual bath</a> at the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qeren_Naftali_fortress\" title=\"Qeren Naftali fortress\">Qeren Naftali fortress</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> was later filled with non-kosher animal bones by a non-Jewish garrison?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qeren_Naftali_fortress","retrieved":1787205437054},{"title":"Abdullah Suriosubroto (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the painter <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdullah_Suriosubroto\" title=\"Abdullah Suriosubroto\">Abdullah Suriosubroto</a></b> was adopted by a National Hero of Indonesia?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdullah_Suriosubroto","retrieved":1787205437055},{"title":"Jimoto Saiko! (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the slice-of-life manga <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jimoto_Saiko!\" title=\"Jimoto Saiko!\">Jimoto Saiko!</a></b></i> focuses on poverty, instead of the genre's usual focus on happy lives?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jimoto_Saiko!","retrieved":1787205437070},{"title":"Wedding Band (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alice_Childress\" title=\"Alice Childress\">Alice Childress</a>'s play <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wedding_Band:_A_Love/Hate_Story_in_Black_and_White\" title=\"Wedding Band: A Love/Hate Story in Black and White\">Wedding Band</a></b></i> was based on a true story told by her grandmother?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wedding_Band:_A_Love/Hate_Story_in_Black_and_White","retrieved":1787205437075},{"title":"Frank Kauer (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frank_Kauer\" title=\"Frank Kauer\">Frank Kauer</a></b> related to his <i>Hollyoaks</i> character because he experienced \"the challenges growing up mixed race brought\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frank_Kauer","retrieved":1787205437076},{"title":"1945 Zhijiang surrender ceremony (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1945_Zhijiang_surrender_ceremony\" title=\"1945 Zhijiang surrender ceremony\">1945 Zhijiang surrender ceremony</a></b> marked the beginning of China's acceptance of Japan's surrender in World War<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>II?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1945_Zhijiang_surrender_ceremony","retrieved":1787205437077},{"title":"Faiza Ali (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faiza_Ali\" title=\"Faiza Ali\">Faiza Ali</a></b>, now New York City's commissioner of immigrant affairs, has said she first became an activist due to experiencing Islamophobia after <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/September_11_attacks\" title=\"September 11 attacks\">9/11</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faiza_Ali","retrieved":1787205437079},{"title":"Rayman Legends Retold (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rayman_Legends_Retold\" title=\"Rayman Legends Retold\">Rayman Legends Retold</a></b></i> producer compared the moment two studios discovered that both wanted to make a <i>Rayman</i> game to the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spider-Man_(1967_TV_series)#Pointing_meme\" title=\"Spider-Man (1967 TV series)\">Spider-Man pointing meme</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rayman_Legends_Retold","retrieved":1787205437080},{"title":"a novelist (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucy_Poate_Stebbins\" title=\"Lucy Poate Stebbins\">a novelist</a></b> and <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Poate_Stebbins\" title=\"Richard Poate Stebbins\">her son</a></b> wrote <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Trollopes:_The_Chronicle_of_a_Writing_Family\" title=\"The Trollopes: The Chronicle of a Writing Family\">a biography on another novelist and her sons</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucy_Poate_Stebbins","retrieved":1787205437082},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Des Moines&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;DesMoinesBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;A capitol building with a golden dome, several art institutions and a State Fair each August; these are some of the things awaiting you in Iowa's largest city.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;fon